<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Dictyostelium discoideum Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.304 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) (Dictyostelium discoideum)",
        "Dictyostelium discoideum Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.304 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) faithfully reproduces Dictyostelium discoideum morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Dictyostelium discoideum specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Dictyostelium discoideum" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: That sorocarps are pigment stripes or ocelli.",
        "does_not_claim: That the phase-singularity model of Taniguchi 2013 was integrated.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg PDE with a=0.16, b=0.94, Du=0.03208776235376616, Dv=0.770106296490388, periodic 80×80 grid, seed 3168.",
        "reported_in_source: Höfer, Sherratt and Maini 1995: cAMP relay plus chemotaxis produces aggregation streams.",
        "reported_in_source: Taniguchi 2013: Dictyostelium PIP3 and F-actin travel as cortical excitable waves.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability at a finite critical wavenumber.",
        "transfer_boundary: Catalog wavelength 2.304 µm (2.304e-06 m, log10=-5.638, tier 3_subcellular_um) is the slot coordinate inside the cortical-wave band, not a printed wet-lab mean.",
        "transfer_boundary: Chronoseries 1/1 at 0 Ma. A 0.20 µm molecular regime admits zero modes; millimetre-scale cAMP waves are a longer regime of the same extant species." ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0.py; output: docs/media/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png; organism: Dictyostelium discoideum; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, pillow 13.0.0; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability at a finite critical wavenumber. | Taniguchi 2013: Dictyostelium PIP3 and F-actin travel as cortical excitable waves. | Höfer, Sherratt and Maini 1995: cAMP relay plus chemotaxis produces aggregation streams.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg PDE with a=0.16, b=0.94, Du=0.03208776235376616, Dv=0.770106296490388, periodic 80×80 grid, seed 3168.; transfer_boundary: Catalog wavelength 2.304 µm (2.304e-06 m, log10=-5.638, tier 3_subcellular_um) is the slot coordinate inside the cortical-wave band, not a printed wet-lab mean. | Chronoseries 1/1 at 0 Ma. A 0.20 µm molecular regime admits zero modes; millimetre-scale cAMP waves are a longer regime of the same extant species.; does_not_claim: That sorocarps are pigment stripes or ocelli. | That the phase-singularity model of Taniguchi 2013 was integrated.]; phenomenon_size: 205 µm (0.0002048 m, log10=-3.689 m, tier=5_primordium_100um); species_scale_ladder (1 runs from 205 µm to 205 µm): 205 µm:limit-cycle-turing" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(79)90042-0>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1218025110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1995.0037>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-10>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-6>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-7>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-8>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-9> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Turing Dispersion" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 7.28e-01 .

